#: MainWindow.cpp:38 MainWindow.cpp:45
msgid "Evernight Vista Repository Manager"
msgstr "Evernight Vista 儲存庫管理員"

#: MainWindow.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Each repository can independently select a mirror source. Click 'Apply' to "
"take effect. Click 'Test Speed' to check the response time of each mirror."
msgstr ""
"每個儲存庫可獨立選擇鏡像來源。點擊「套用」使其生效。點擊「測速」檢查各鏡像的回應時間。"

