#: MainWindow.cpp:307
msgid ""
"Perform system maintenance tasks for DNF/RPM. Each action asks for "
"administrator authentication through polkit."
msgstr "執行 DNF/RPM 的系統維護任務。每項操作都透過 polkit 要求管理員認證。"

#: MainWindow.cpp:313
msgid "Repair RPM Database"
msgstr "修復 RPM 資料庫"

#: MainWindow.cpp:317
msgid "Clean Unused Packages (autoremove)"
msgstr "清理未使用的軟體套件（autoremove）"

#: MainWindow.cpp:321
msgid "Synchronize Distribution (distro-sync)"
msgstr "同步發行版（distro-sync）"

#: MainWindow.cpp:374
msgid "This will rebuild the RPM database using 'rpm --rebuilddb'. Continue?"
msgstr "這將使用「rpm --rebuilddb」重建 RPM 資料庫。是否繼續？"

#: MainWindow.cpp:380
msgid "Repairing RPM database..."
msgstr "正在修復 RPM 資料庫……"

#: MainWindow.cpp:385
msgid ""
"This will remove unnecessary packages via 'dnf autoremove -y'. Continue?"
msgstr "這將透過「dnf autoremove -y」移除不必要的軟體套件。是否繼續？"

#: MainWindow.cpp:391
msgid "Cleaning unused packages..."
msgstr "正在清理未使用的軟體套件……"

#: MainWindow.cpp:396
msgid ""
"This will synchronize your system with the repository via 'dnf distro-sync "
"-y'. Continue?"
msgstr "這將透過「dnf distro-sync -y」使您的系統與儲存庫同步。是否繼續？"

#: MainWindow.cpp:402
msgid "Synchronizing distribution..."
msgstr "正在同步發行版……"

